    <!-- FAQ SECTION: 8 CURATED QUESTIONS -->
    <div id="faq" class="nk-faq max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-nk-done="1">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <span class="text-gold text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Information</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-navy">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left font-semibold text-navy text-sm sm:text-base">
            <span>What’s the difference between Deluxe and Premium houseboats?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-xs transition-transform duration-200"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Premium boats add larger rooms, a more spacious deck and a higher level of onboard service. The exact inclusions are shown on each boat’s detail page.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left font-semibold text-navy text-sm sm:text-base">
            <span>Should I book a private or a sharing houseboat?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-xs transition-transform duration-200"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Private is best for families, couples and celebrations. Sharing is a more social way to enjoy the same waterway at a lighter price.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left font-semibold text-navy text-sm sm:text-base">
            <span>What time is check-in and check-out?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-xs transition-transform duration-200"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Overnight cruises generally check in at 12:00 PM and return after breakfast at 9:00 AM. Day cruises typically run from late morning to 5:00 PM.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left font-semibold text-navy text-sm sm:text-base">
            <span>Does the houseboat cruise at night?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-xs transition-transform duration-200"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The boat moors in the evening for safety and comfort. You still get a beautiful sunset, dinner on the water and a quiet night onboard.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left font-semibold text-navy text-sm sm:text-base">
            <span>What’s included in the price?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-xs transition-transform duration-200"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Your package includes the selected cruise, crew service and the meals listed on the boat page. Add-ons and full-time AC are shown before you enquire.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left font-semibold text-navy text-sm sm:text-base">
            <span>Do the bedrooms have attached bathrooms?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-xs transition-transform duration-200"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Most listed houseboats include attached bathrooms. Check the Amenities & Inclusions section of your chosen boat for confirmation.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left font-semibold text-navy text-sm sm:text-base">
            <span>How many guests can stay in each bedroom?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-xs transition-transform duration-200"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Room capacity varies by boat. Our team will confirm the most comfortable arrangement for your group before booking.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80">
          <button onclick="toggleFaq(this)" class="w-full flex justify-between items-center text-left font-semibold text-navy text-sm sm:text-base">
            <span>Can we arrange a honeymoon or celebration setup?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-slate-400 text-xs transition-transform duration-200"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="hidden mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Yes. Tell us what you have in mind on WhatsApp and we can arrange flowers, cake or a simple celebration setup at an additional cost.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
