      ['Do the bedrooms have attached bathrooms?','Most listed houseboats include attached bathrooms. Check the Amenities & Inclusions section of your chosen boat for confirmation.'],
      ['How many guests can stay in each bedroom?','Room capacity varies by boat. Our team will confirm the most comfortable arrangement for your group before booking.'],
